  "details": "Hello! I downloaded VRChat and wanted to play, but I ran into this problem: I go into the game under the steam profile (I also used the VRChat account), it logs in and joins the Hub, it goes up to 100% and I show up in the Hub, but I can not do anything (I I did not use the VR device, so I tried to move with the mouse or keyboard, but nothing came out), while VRChat loading appears on the screen, and after the inscription \"Logging in throught Steam .... (My nickname steam)\", and takes me to the previous point where the download occurs in Hub and the same thing happens: I can not do anything again make and appear inscriptions after which I again go to the previous paragraph, and so endlessly. Please help very much want to play in VRChat)",
